<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - insolvencies, prod/import prices.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - insolvencies, prod/import prices.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Insolvencies	Aug	    July +10.2 pct y/y   Nov 19-20</p>
<p> Producer prices   Oct	    Sept +0.2 pct m/m    Nov 21-22</p>
<p> Import prices     Oct	    Sept +0.7 pct m/m    Nov 22-25</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
